  "prefLabel": "Plc 313.28 Substantially Similar Requirements for the Profession Regulated by the Governing Board of Genetic Counselors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 313.28 Substantially Similar Requirements for the Profession Regulated by the Governing Board of Genetic Counselors. For purposes of obtaining a license by endorsement as a genetic counselor, as regulated by the governing board of genetic counselors, the current requirements of the licensing jurisdiction shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Pass the examination of the American Board of Genetic Counseling (ABGC).\n\nSource. #13954, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #1 at part heading for Plc 313)",
